知道那个狗杂种<color=red>在府里放了把火</color>，烧到库房后那些烟火什戏就<color=red>爆炸了！</color>","#","^Layout:Left ","/#","#","^Name:关三柱 ","/#","#","^Speaker:GSZ_Anger","/#","\n","^就那样一声巨响，天翻地覆，俺连个反应的机会都没有，就在库房被炸死了。","#","^Layout:Left ","/#","#","^CE:Text_deadcause_被炸死 ","/#","#","^Name:关三柱 ","/#","#","^Speaker:GSZ_Anger","/#","\n",{"->":"c8_1"},{"#f":5}],"c-2":["\n","^<align=\"center\"><color=red>===关三柱死前的身份===</color>","#","^Layout:Right ","/#","#","^Name:判官 ","/#","#","^Speaker:GSZ_Normal","/#","\n","^你之前的身份是什么？","#","^Layout:Right ","/#","#","^Name:判官 ","/#","#","^Speaker:GSZ_Normal","/#","\n","^<color=red>俺叫关三柱，曾是个当兵的</color>，现在帮薛老爷干活。","#","^Layout:Left ","/#","#","^Name:关三柱 ","/#","#","^Speaker:GSZ_Happy","/#","\n","^薛老爷救过俺命，但俺是个粗人，没啥大本事，空会些拳脚功夫，只能<color=red>给薛老爷当个护院</color>，干些脏话累活。","#","^Layout:Left ","/#","#","^CE:Text_identity_官府护卫 ","/#","#","^Name:关三柱 ","/#","#","^Speaker:GSZ_Happy","/#","\n","^<align=\"center\"><color=red>---身份询问结束---</color>","#","^Layout:Right ","/#","#","^Name:判官 ","/#","#","^Speaker:GSZ_Happy","/#","\n","ev",true,"/ev",{"VAR=":"identity","re":true},{"->":"StartTalk"},{"#f":5}]}]}],"nop","\n",{"#f":1}],"StartTalk":[{"->":"Prefont"},{"#f":1}],"c8_1":[[["ev",{"^->":"c8_1.0.0.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^库房里为什么放着烟火？  ","#","^Layout:Right ","/#","#","^Name:判官 ","/#","#","^Speaker:GSZ_Anger","/#",{"->":"$r","var":true},null]}],{"c-0":["ev",{"^->":"c8_1.0.c-0.$r2"},"/ev",{"temp=":"$r"},{"->":".^.^.0.s"},[{"#n":"$r2"}],"\n",{"->":"c8_2"},{"#f":5}]}],{"#f":1}],"c8_2":[["^哎，老爷这些个月足不出户，俺想着在府里也放放烟火<color=red>庆祝中秋节</color>，好让老爷高兴高兴。","#","^Layout:Left ","/#","#","^Name:关三柱 ","/#","#","^Speaker:GSZ_Sad","/#","\n","^哪知道却成了催命的玩意儿……","#","^Layout:Left ","/#","#","^Name:关三柱 ","/#","#","^Speaker:GSZ_Sad","/#","\n",["ev",{"^->":"c8_2.0.22.$r1"},{"temp=":"$r"},"str",{"->":".^.s"},[{"#n":"$r1"}],"/str","/ev",{"*":".^.^.c-0","flg":18},{"s":["^薛怀逸为什么不出门？","#","^Layout:Right ","/#","#","^Name:判官 ","/#","#","^